    <coloph>rgyud gyi rgyal po gser gyi rus sbal rdo rje theg pa rtsa ba'i rgyud// rgyud gyi ma mo// sems phyogs kyi phyi mo// lta ba thams cad kyi phugs dgongs pa'i gdeng rdzogso// //sa ma ya so phag shi kha thams// nor 'dod bu pho dge slong bdag 'dra yis// rin chen sna lnga'i snying po gser khyer nas// rin chen srog la ma 'dzems dka' ba'i la rnams bsgal// nges pa'i snying po byang sems rgyud mad rtsa gnyis btsal// 'jam dpal bshes gnyen bla ma dang// bdag 'dra bai ro tsa na yis// sgra skad bstun te chan la phab nas kyang// bod kyi yul du rmongs pa tshan gsum byung ba cha mchis nas// 'dir drangs mnga' bdag rgyal po nyid kyi phyag tu phul// rmongs pa tshan gsum dus na dar bar shog/ dang po bai ro tsa nas bsgyur// de nas lho brag nas khyung grags kyis gter nas gton pa'o</coloph>
